flowchart TD
    User([User Browser]) -->|1. Access Website| S3[(S3 Website Bucket)]
    User -->|2. View Dashboard| S3
    
    S3 -->|3. Make API Calls| APIG[API Gateway]
    APIG -->|4. Invoke Lambda| Lambda[Lambda Proxy]
    Lambda -->|5. Call Well-Architected API| WA[AWS Well-Architected API]
    WA -->|6. Return Assessment Data| Lambda
    Lambda -->|7. Return with CORS Headers| APIG
    APIG -->|8. Return JSON Response| S3
    
    CF[CloudFront Distribution] -.->|Optional CDN| S3
    
    subgraph CloudFormation
        Master[Master Stack] -->|Orchestrates| Infra[Infrastructure Stack]
        Master -->|Orchestrates| LambdaStack[Lambda Stack]
        Master -->|Orchestrates| Content[Content Stack]
    end
    
    Infra -->|Provisions| S3
    Infra -->|Provisions| CF
    LambdaStack -->|Provisions| APIG
    LambdaStack -->|Provisions| Lambda
    Content -->|Deploys Files to| S3
    
    classDef aws fill:#FF9900,stroke:#232F3E,color:black;
    classDef stack fill:#1E88E5,stroke:#0D47A1,color:white;
    classDef user fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:white;
    classDef cf fill:#232F3E,stroke:#232F3E,color:white;
    
    class S3,APIG,Lambda,WA,CF aws;
    class Master,Infra,LambdaStack,Content stack;
    class User user;
    class CloudFormation cf;
